 {:db/id "4ba2450b-9191-5719-9d3a-3e62924942b9"
  :answer/id #uuid "4ba2450b-9191-5719-9d3a-3e62924942b9"
  :answer/type :answer.type/text
  :answer/value "Reading coefficients in the order $x,y,z$ gives\n$$A=\\begin{pmatrix}7&2&1\\\\3&-11&2\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad T(\\mathbf x)=A\\mathbf x.$$\nFor all $\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\in\\mathbb R^3$ and scalars $\\alpha,\\beta$,\n$$T(\\alpha\\mathbf u+\\beta\\mathbf v)=A(\\alpha\\mathbf u+\\beta\\mathbf v)=\\alpha A\\mathbf u+\\beta A\\mathbf v=\\alpha T(\\mathbf u)+\\beta T(\\mathbf v).$$\nTherefore $T$ is linear."
  :db/ensure :answer/validate}
