 {:db/id "37f6e35e-1720-59c1-a040-01cc1f370f66"
  :answer/id #uuid "37f6e35e-1720-59c1-a040-01cc1f370f66"
  :answer/type :answer.type/text
  :answer/value "The composition applies $T$ first, then $S$, so $(S\\circ T)(\\mathbf x)=B(A\\mathbf x)=(BA)\\mathbf x$. Thus\n$$BA=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-2\\\\4&2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}3&1\\\\-1&2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&-4\\\\10&8\\end{pmatrix}.$$\nThen\n$$\\begin{pmatrix}2&-4\\\\10&8\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\12\\end{pmatrix}.$$\nIndependently, $T(2,-1)^T=(5,-4)^T$, and $S(5,-4)^T=(8,12)^T$, confirming the order and result."
  :db/ensure :answer/validate}
