 {:db/id "b238792a-6767-5268-ac47-39d0aa4f68d6"
  :answer/id #uuid "b238792a-6767-5268-ac47-39d0aa4f68d6"
  :answer/type :answer.type/text
  :answer/value "The determinant is $\\det A=2\\cdot2-1\\cdot5=-1\\ne0$, so the inverse transformation exists. It is induced by\n$$A^{-1}=\\frac1{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&-1\\\\-5&2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1\\\\5&-2\\end{pmatrix}.$$\nMultiplying in either order gives $AA^{-1}=A^{-1}A=I_2$, so $\\mathbf x\\mapsto A^{-1}\\mathbf x$ reverses $T$."
  :db/ensure :answer/validate}
